		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "bb2afcca-7cb2-40e2-9553-7c70f7c22ea5")
		(at 20 19)
		(descr "PLACEHOLDER - confirm. Wink switch P204 (D-499): a board-mount SPDT momentary pushbutton under a lit 17 x 15 key cap, C&K 8125 class, no part chosen. Three 1.0 mm holes on a 2.54 mm row carry the symbol's pins - 1 NC (the contact the pole rests on), 2 common, 3 NO - so a switch on leads or a small breakout fits now; the 12 mm square is the body (confirm), the dashed 17 x 15 on F.Fab is the sketch's cap, lit by the 0603 LED beside the body. Origin = the cap's centre. Replace with the chosen part's drawn footprint; if the part carries its own LED the face LED moves onto its pins. No 3D model")
